{"text":"太昌元年十二月十二日壬亥朔，佛弟子楊元凱爲亡父母造多寶佛兩區在窟。願亡父母離其三徒八難，託生西方安樂之處，值遇諸佛，恒與善因。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"楊元凱","refId":null,"text":"楊元凱","start":17,"end":20},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"多寶","refId":null,"text":"多寶","start":25,"end":27},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三途","refId":null,"text":"三徒","start":39,"end":41},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"八難","refId":null,"text":"八難","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":44,"end":46},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"西方","refId":null,"text":"西方","start":46,"end":48},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"安樂","refId":null,"text":"安樂","start":48,"end":50}]}